cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, cite it as below."
title: "The index: everything NaNoBotCo holds, counted once"
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of the corpora, sites and repositories published by NaNoBotCo, with a
  count for each read from a named source, its provenance, its licence and its terms.
  Served as HTML, text, JSON, JSON-LD and llms.txt and re-counted nightly.
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: CC-BY-4.0
